  str_mail_vote_detail_1 = "I've never expected such solid support from anyone... Thank you, Navigator. I shall stand by you likewise in return.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_2 = "Wow, Navigator, did you go all out just so I have nice a outfit to wear? Oh, I'm so touched, I'll drop a few Holy Water Shells your way right now!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_3 = "What's the point of a new outfit...? But if it's from you, I do look forward to it... I just want to say... thank you.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_4 = "Oh my, all that effort for my new outfit? You shouldn't have! May the afternoon breeze carry my gratitude to you!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_5 = "Growing up, I never had any apparel I could call my own other than an assortment of uniforms. Thank you for making me think about this issue, Navigator.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_6 = "Thank you for your persistence, Navigator. You've made me realize maybe it's time to improve how I dress. I see it as a type of discipline and I will work to maintain.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_7 = "It is my honor as a noble to gain your recognition and support. Admittedly, I am not familiar with the latest fashion. Is it okay to hear your thoughts sometime?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_8 = "Thank you for your trust and support. Did you cast your vote for Carleen? She has been working hard and I hope you can look after her.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_9 = "Oh, the great Navigator ♪ It seems you are very fond of us ♪ But even so ♪ It doesn't stop your hairline from receding ♪",
  str_mail_vote_detail_10 = "Thank you, Navigator, but how did you know I have no money for clothes? Allow me to buy you a round of coffee next time, if you don't mind...",
  str_mail_vote_detail_11 = "Well, you've been helping me unconditionally all along, so I have no idea how I can repay you... I know, I'll play a tune specifically for you when no one's around! Is that okay?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_12 = "Heh, interesting. To me, I can always use another set of nice clothes. Thanks. Oh, I'll get you something trendy, too, in return when I get around to it.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_13 = "I could feel the trust from you when you voted for me. Was it out of affection, brave voyager?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_14 = "Yes, timely support is tantamount to striking at the exact moment, requiring a mind of artful precision which you, Navigator, possess. Thank you, I will cherish this.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_15 = "Pfft, this is awkward. Stop beating around the bush and tell me what you want from me... Wow, what a pleasant surprise.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_16 = "You're trying hard to make me happy, aren't you? So, what kind of outfit do you want me to wear?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_17 = "You want me to get the opportunity? I appreciate it, kid. After I win, how about we celebrate over a glass or two?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_18 = "I've gotten used to hiding in the shadows a long time ago, but I'll still hang out with you youngsters once in a while. I just didn't expect so much support from you. Alright, I'll give you a three-move head start in our next chess game!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_19 = "I cannot fathom your elation and anticipation, but thank you nevertheless. To reciprocate, would you care to take a nap in the black wooden chest?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_20 = "Wow, is it really for me? Even though I'm cursed, I still get lucky sometimes, like getting unwavering support from you, Navigator. Please allow me to ponder how to thank you...",
  str_mail_vote_detail_21 = "Anyway, I'll take it. But isn't this a waste of money to give me a new outfit? Alter it to fit Robyn if I win, Boatscrapper.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_22 = "You don't have to spend resources on me, Navigator. Expenses like maintaining the Colossus and accommodating guests cost a lot of money. However, the thought does make me happy and feel blessed!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_23 = "Thank you for this! A durable, fitting outfit that facilitates training is just what a warrior needs. Speaking of that, when are you going to train with me for once?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_24 = "Aha, you really are my best bud! Any costume wardrobe is always one \"last piece\" short of perfect. We're totally in sync! Thank you so much!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_25 = "I didn't think you cared about me this much. How about this: You can borrow any new outfit I get, but you have to be my test subject in return. That's fair, right?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_26 = "I am fortunate to be loved by you. Life is short, but it is not a waste if one stops to smell the roses.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_27 = "The excellent \"skin\" will definitely boost my gaming performance. I guess you've finally caught on, Navigator! I appreciate it a lot!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_28 = "Thank you for pointing out a new direction to me. I can't lose to Reinhardt, at least when it comes to clothes owned!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_29 = "New uniform? Does this mean a new arena? Sure, keep voting for me! You'll make out like a bandit when it's done!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_30 = "Actually, I've collected many wonderful outfits during my time adventuring with you, Navigator, and you still would save the precious opportunity for me despite that? Well, I will strive to keep the book for you!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_31 = "I'll only going to tell you this, meow! I feel your love for me and that makes me very happy, meow! After I try this on, let's go take a nap under the sun, meow!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_32 = "Wow! You do get it! Something to wear that's perfect for fighting!—Benny\nI get one too? A wise decision that deserves my appreciation.—Curo",
  str_mail_vote_detail_33 = "Your support has given me much strength, and that makes you a worthy friend of justice! If you don't mind, please allow me to stitch \"Justice\" on your clothes!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_34 = "What? This is definitely not in the plan, though I don't hate it at all. Let's make custom outfit a part of the plan then. I'll work hard at it!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_35 = "Well, I'm not exactly hurting for outfits here, but since you voted for me, the least I can do is try it on... No, don't get me wrong, I'm not looking forward to it at all!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_36 = "I know what you chose, so allow me to thank you. However, even though a diamond is beautiful, what truly captivates is its meaning, am I correct?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_37 = "I didn't think you would vote for me, Navigator. New costume, eh? The idea does excite me. I can probably use it for my next survey trip.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_38 = "Wow, I love events like this! I haven't bought a new outfit in ages! If I win a new costume, I have to show it off to Louise and Her Majesty immediately!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_39 = "It's awesome to get so many votes from you! Let me perform a magic trick for you in appreciation! Elves, please get the candy boxes ready!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_40 = "New costume? I think I get it! It's like giving my tools and mechs a new coat of paint every once in a while. Hee, I can't wait to see what \"coat of paint\" you have for me, Navigator.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_41 = "Well, can't say I was interested in this, but the bullets, clips, and shell cases are all clamoring for a new skin, so let me thank you on their behalf.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_42 = "What a surprise this is! You know, you could've just joined the Rediesel Wrench if you liked me so much! Then you won't have to vote and I'll give you the pants off my legs!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_43 = "You voted for me? I'm so happy! I'd love to show off any new costume I get to my brother and you, Navigator.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_44 = "What, that many votes? How should I thank you? New costume... I'll be ecstatic if it's Coolster with gloves.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_45 = "The new outfit must be a gorgeous costume specially designed for a marquee star... I can't wait to play the stage already! Seeing how many times you voted for me, here's a VIP ticket to the concert!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_46 = "Much love of Rediesel and the hot sweetheart! Your idol Barbara has also thrown her hat into the ring! I got your enthusiasm and support! You'll get a signed photo later!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_47 = "Thank you for liking me. If possible, I would like Eve to receive a new costume too. Will you vote for her as well?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_48 = "It doesn't matter what techies wear, but I'll still thank you in advance. Man, another leak...? Let me catch back up with you after I fix it.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_49 = "I've been wanting a new outfit for a long time now, but how did you find out? You're looking forward to me interrogating you in it, aren't you, Navigator?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_50 = "Yes, yes, it all goes as expected but still, your support is appreciated. All part of The Knowledge's plan, I am sure.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_51 = "Oh, you're voting for me. Okay, I shall await the result. But if I notice any rigging going on, they will have to answer to my thorns.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_52 = "Navigator, even when you vote for me, I still... No, on second thought, are you trying to cover up the crystals on me? I can't believe I failed to see your noble intent...",
  str_mail_vote_detail_53 = "Have you been voting for me? Have you fallen for my charm? Why don't you come and have a drink with me afterward? Of course, it's on you.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_54 = "Great faith is worth sacrificing everything for; inner peace, sanity, even our life and soul... Thank you for supporting me. It would be even better if you'd join us.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_55 = "So I have to be in because you voted for me? No way, I want to win only if you didn't vote for me! Got that? Your vote made me a little happy, but only a little, so don't read too much into it!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_56 = "Please don't put me with anybody in the competition. I like my space and quiet... Wait, I didn't tell you to leave. Also, thank you for your support...",
  str_mail_vote_detail_57 = "Whoa, I never thought you'd get behind me. Guess you've improved your taste in music? Then, let me play a tune for you as my sincerest gratitude!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_58 = "I appreciate your support that gave me the title. Thank you. I've declined the honor before because I received bliss a long time ago. But for you and the quest into the past with that certain person, I will keep working hard.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_59 = "Incineration will turn all beauty to ashes, so what do you expect? Your idea is puzzling... but I will fulfill your expectations as my appreciation for you choosing me.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_60 = "You want me to have a chance at a new outfit? In exchange, I can tell you a once-upon-a-time story... Right, it has nothing to do with the stars but the Emperor's new clothes.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_61 = "Do you have a problem with my flimsy uniform? Whatever. No matter what I wear, it won't diminish my charm and greatness, but you still deserve praise for voting for the right person.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_62 = "Thank you for the nice gesture. Since everything exists in the will of nature, would you be interested in taking a stroll in the forest with me to enjoy the beauty of nature?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_63 = "You seem very interested in changing my appearance. Since your vote, a symbol called happiness has been added to my memory. It felt... marvelous.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_64 = "Does the fact you voted for me that many times mean you like me very much? If Mia finds out, she just might cry happy tears!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_65 = "Is this Dayna's idea? No? I thought... So this is how highly you think of me? I'll do my best to not let you down...",
  str_mail_vote_detail_66 = "I'm shocked. There must be hundreds of Aurorians on the Colossus, yet you cast your precious vote for me. I shall repay your support three-fold.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_67 = "I'm relieved to see you doing fine since you took the time to care about what a veteran wears. I accept the offer and take care of yourself.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_68 = "Am I gonna be pretty? Thanks. I didn't expect this and I'm very happy.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_69 = "Normally, judges have their own dress code. However, since you believe there's a need, I shall accept it gladly. I appreciate this very much, and until we meet again.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_70 = "Hey pal, even the mercenaries know about you voting for me. I'm touched you didn't forget me. Win or lose, I'm willing to look better for you.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_71 = "Thanks, buddy. I've seen countless offerings in Umbraton and I'm not feeling this. You want me to win this time...? Well, how about getting the guild to chip in?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_72 = "I've etched your thoughts and regards on the ice of the Winter Palace. I'm glad to see you remain so pure despite everything you've been through. Thank you.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_73 = "I see you voted for me. I honestly didn't expect to prance on the stage as an organizer... Thanks, but I'm more concerned with whether you enjoyed the festivity.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_74 = "Wow, what a great surprise! I've always wanted to be a part of an event like this, all dressed up and enjoying the spotlight! Promise you'll be on stage with me!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_75 = "Are you embroiled in some sort of conspiracy, Captain, or were you destined to support an Ascended like me? You don't have to tell me! It's essential to garner support in the fight against the unknown. Thanks!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_76 = "You want to see me in anything but this uniform? I can comply, if that's your request. For my appreciation, I'll buy you a round next time. Don't worry, I'll order something normal.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_77 = "White Night up high! Is this for me? Yes, I see I'll have to endeavor to meet your expectations. Thank you, the Last Caelestite. Don't forget to nourish yourself and drink more water.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_78 = "Hey, little caelestite, is this vote for me? Hmm... Ruby doesn't seem to be here, then I must be right. Thanks! But with you buttering me up, I have to win now, don't I?!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_79 = "Isn't it the Navigator! I haven't had a nice outfit in a long time. No matter the outcome, I appreciate the thought very much!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_80 = "When did the shy Navigator become so bold? So you want to see me in a certain outfit, do you? Worry not, I'll win it for you.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_81 = "I've got enough outfits, kid! And I keep ruining the uniforms... But thanks anyway, kid. To repay you, I'll tailor a new training agenda just for you.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_82 = "The Grand Marshal is the role model of Illumina, and you want me to change into something else? I'm making it hard on you? Never mind, I can't question a comrade's goodwill, so thanks! I shall be victorious in the contest.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_83 = "Want Axelia to look prettier? But I glow already. What impression will I leave in a different costume, though? Hmm, I'm not sure, but I know I must thank you.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_84 = "Oh, thank you for the support! A new outfit would cut down on how many times I come back to the Colossus in a bloodstained uniform! Sorry, hope I didn't gross you out when that happened.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_85 = "Thank you for helping me out. I'll vote for you if a contest like this happens again. So, how do you feel about a competition for the sturdiest, tightest belt?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_86 = "I see you have the idle time to witness me in whole new attire... I appreciate it. And given the chance, I shall be seen in all my splendor!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_87 = "You would like to take this opportunity to make a new outfit for me? I am grateful and shall cherish it. However... is it possible to make a kitty costume for my brother?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_88 = "You wish to order a new outfit for me? It's very thoughtful of you. Although I possessed a wonderful wardrobe, it pales in the presence of your sweet sincerity.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_89 = "You really want to fix me up with some nice threads? Much appreciated. And you know it won't be fair if I don't do something nice for you in return, right?",
  str_mail_vote_detail_90 = "For me? Are you sure? Thank you very much! I don't know what to say other than that. I'll do my best, so please keep helping me out.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_91 = "Clothes are merely covers, yet you manage to give them special meanings. Thank you, young Caelestite. I appreciate the sincerity in giving a courier a gift.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_92 = "Yawn... Oh, I feel bad to wake up and see you running around on my behalf. I got to return the favor. I should make... a note of it... in my journal... yawn...",
  str_mail_vote_detail_93 = "I'm grateful for your vote! I only joined to ensure the competition's fairness and the results won't mean much to me, but I'm still honored to have your recognition.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_94 = "You want to see me in peasant costume, don't you? I'll let you know my family is in the luxury business! I'll take the vote if you insist, but how can one be enough?!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_95 = "Thanks for your vote, though I'm not confident about winning such a vibrant event, to be honest. If you're interested, however, we can meet offstage. I have a lot of fun facts to share.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_96 = "Thank you. I didn't expect you to care if I have enough costumes for infiltration. Even if I don't win a new outfit suitable for missions, I'll make sure I can accommodate the next assignment from you.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_97 = "I feel guilty for all the support you're offering me. I promised you an apprenticeship and gourmet meals made by gadgets, only for you to give me outfits without me fulfilling anything. I'm ashamed. I'll spell my name backward if I don't come through next time!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_98 = "Wow, thank you for voting to make me a new outfit! A vote, a vote, I got a vote! Might not get a new outfit, but I don't care! A true friend is better than any clothes!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_99 = "You want to get a new costume for me? This is embarrassing... I don't think I'm worthy of it since I run around in the mountains all day. But I can give you some nice bracelets, though.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_100 = "Thank you, Navigator. You still have me in mind even in a contest like this, helping me win. Actually, I don't care much for looks, but I'll remember this.",
  str_mail_vote_detail_101 = "Bonus from The Last Caelestite? A reward for Zeta the Warrior? Wow, how wonderful, Last Caelestite! Just you watch, Zeta is invincible!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_102 = "Thanks... From all perspectives, appearance does serve to cover up unattractive high-performance parts. But rather than spending money on it, it would be better if it was free!",
  str_mail_vote_detail_103 = "In this long journey, I often think of those companions who fought side by side with me; their courage and strength have given me endless encouragement. I have seen countless enemies fall under my sword and felt the pain and fatigue brought by battle. But every time I swing my sword, it is a steadfast adherence to my beliefs. I believe that a sword is not just a weapon, but also a symbol of spirit, an unyielding will."
}
return config
